<title>USA: IPO PRICING-Medirisk, at low end of range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-Medirisk, at low end of range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			 Medirisk Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $11</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $11 - $13</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,300,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter    Equitable Securities Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The number of shares was cut to 2.3 million from a prior estimate of 2.5 million. In the initial September 1996 filing, the company had proposed to offer three million shares in the same price range with Smith Barney as the lead underwriter.</p>
<p>The Atlanta-based company provides database and decision-support software.</p>
</text>
